'''Shonen Manga''' (少年ニャンプ, ''Shōnen Nyanpu'', '''Shōnen Nyamp''') was a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Shonen Manga|Unit Attack Up (Sm)|Captain Cat|Angry Delinquent Cat|Frog Ninja Cat|jpname=少年ニャンプ|link=}}
}}

==Trivia==
*Shonen Manga's Japanese name, Shōnen Nyamp (少年ニャンプ), was a reference to the manga magazine ''[[wikipedia:Weekly Shōnen Jump|Weekly Shōnen Jump]]''.
*Each unit in this [[Cat Combo|Combo]] represented a different shōnen manga: [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Captain Cat]] was ''[[wikipedia:One Piece|One Piece]]'', [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Angry Delinquent Cat]] was ''[[wikipedia:JoJo's Bizarre Adventure|JoJo's Bizarre Adventure]]'', and [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cat]] was ''[[wikipedia:Naruto|Naruto]]''.

